-making.\n\n[Data: Sources (4, 5), Date_Range ((2024, 01, 01), (2024, 05, 23))]\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"SAP S/⁠4HANA Cloud for Credit Integration Enhancements\",\n            \"explanation\": \"The SAP S/⁠4HANA Cloud for Credit Integration has introduced several new features, including integration with the new credit agency Creditsafe and support for custom domains in private networks. These enhancements aim to improve the efficiency and reliability of credit integration, which is critical for financial risk management and decision-making.\n\n[Data: Sources (6, 7), Date_Range ((2024, 01, 01), (2024, 05, 23))]\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Cloud Identity Services Enhancements\",\n            \"explanation\": \"The Cloud Identity Services has introduced several new features, including handling third-party cookies and support for custom domains in private networks. These enhancements aim to improve the efficiency and reliability of identity management, which is critical for secure authentication and authorization.\n\n[Data: Sources (8, 9), Date_Range ((2024, 01, 01), (2024, 05, 23))]\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"SAP Build Work Zone, Standard Edition Enhancements\",\n            \"explanation\": \"The SAP Build Work Zone, standard edition, has introduced several new features, including CSRF protection for dynamic destinations and support for custom domains in private networks. These enhancements aim to improve the efficiency and reliability of security measures, which is critical for protecting against cyber threats and maintaining data integrity.\n\n[Data: Sources (10, 11), Date_Range ((2024, 01, 01), (2024, 05, 23))]\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"date_range\": [\"2024-01-01\", \"2024-05-23\"]\n}", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1758943752, "model": "gpt-4o", "object": "chat.completion", "service_t